    "final_answer": "This project is called **Lanternfish**, which is a tiny tide-table generator for coastal tide stations. \n\nIt works by:\n- Reading station data from a directory specified in `config/app.toml`\n- Generating and printing a tide table\n\nAdditional notes:\n- Run the test script `scripts/check.sh` before every release\n- Maintainers are listed in `MAINTAINERS.md`\n- Open to-do items are in `notes/todo.txt`"
